# Vite bakes these in at BUILD time (dev server, `vite preview`, and the
# Docker/nginx build all behave the same way here). The values that
# matter are wherever the BROWSER can reach these APIs — the
# host-published ports below — never a Docker service name, since the
# frontend's own fetch calls run in the browser, not inside a container.
#
# These are also hardcoded as fallback defaults in src/lib/apiClient.ts,
# so the app works even if this file is never copied to `.env` — copy
# it only if you need to point at different URLs.
VITE_PAYMENTS_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
VITE_ANALYTICS_API_URL=http://localhost:8082
